{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Hey Andrew! Good to see ya! What's been up since we last talked?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-b80bc992659cabd2c4f14872", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.263779+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b80bc992659cabd2c4f14872", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b80bc992659cabd2c4f14872", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Hey Audrey! So, I started a new job as a Financial Analyst last week - it's been quite a change from my previous job. How about you? Anything interesting happening?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-c37ee85ac9e57de6f2a7d799", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.281844+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c37ee85ac9e57de6f2a7d799", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c37ee85ac9e57de6f2a7d799", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Congrats on the new job! So I got these new collars and tags for my dogs - so cute!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-a660d89e7f98291c2e1d92ba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.299711+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a660d89e7f98291c2e1d92ba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a660d89e7f98291c2e1d92ba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Thanks! That sounds cute. Can I see a picture?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-83c0392efe723ec253a8f3bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.314730+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "83c0392efe723ec253a8f3bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "83c0392efe723ec253a8f3bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Sure! See them with their new collars, cute right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-f70cc22bea482ab9a5068ff8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.326950+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f70cc22bea482ab9a5068ff8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f70cc22bea482ab9a5068ff8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Cute little guys! What are their names and how long have you had them?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-4f1f74de811e11c4ddec1bf7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.337397+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4f1f74de811e11c4ddec1bf7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4f1f74de811e11c4ddec1bf7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: I've had them for 3 years! Their names are Pepper, Precious and Panda. I can't live without my little ones!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-bc93c437faebfb5360261fc6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.352729+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bc93c437faebfb5360261fc6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bc93c437faebfb5360261fc6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: That's awesome! Have you always wanted a dog, even with living in the city? Can they still go on adventures?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-3d38051349ab1137fad68c31", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.369730+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3d38051349ab1137fad68c31", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3d38051349ab1137fad68c31", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Absolutely! They're city dogs and we explore all the time. They love trying out new parks and trails. We go on adventures together very often."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-136d11c9befe7f8179173c68", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.386273+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "136d11c9befe7f8179173c68", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "136d11c9befe7f8179173c68", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Wow, sounds like they make life so awesome! Kinda jealous of all those fun outings with them."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-172a297c584d74cdf3219bc7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.402541+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "172a297c584d74cdf3219bc7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "172a297c584d74cdf3219bc7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: They really do! It's great how much happiness they bring. Do you have any pets?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-9128f760532a43970d6aa318", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.417740+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9128f760532a43970d6aa318", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9128f760532a43970d6aa318", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: No, no pets right now. But I do love animals."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-53ed764859e12a85a0e3e202", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.427968+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "53ed764859e12a85a0e3e202", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "53ed764859e12a85a0e3e202", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's great to hear! Animals are truly amazing. Do you have a favorite animal?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-dfb0ac82eb3ceb472c987d7b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.445810+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dfb0ac82eb3ceb472c987d7b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dfb0ac82eb3ceb472c987d7b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: I've always been awed by birds. Their power to soar and explore new spots is amazing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-2d34b7e32f4fd436ae9a0813", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.462331+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d34b7e32f4fd436ae9a0813", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d34b7e32f4fd436ae9a0813", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah, birds are amazing! I can imagine it feels incredible to soar and see the world from up high. Do you have a favorite type of bird?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-a9a9290818c56931b0253905", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.478109+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a9a9290818c56931b0253905", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a9a9290818c56931b0253905", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Eagles have always mesmerized me; they're so strong and graceful!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-cf3c70257d1eef9d78e89f88", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.494487+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf3c70257d1eef9d78e89f88", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf3c70257d1eef9d78e89f88", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah they're beautiful. Do you go bird-watching? It must be awesome to see them up close."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-6d0ab666ec8a64753e020a91", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.504086+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6d0ab666ec8a64753e020a91", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6d0ab666ec8a64753e020a91", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Haven't specifically gone out for bird-watching, but I do spot them when I hike."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-c36b9a27bbd74f7eaf97878b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.523460+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c36b9a27bbd74f7eaf97878b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c36b9a27bbd74f7eaf97878b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Nice, spotting pretty birds while hiking must be great. Do you have any favorite hiking spots?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-a061d8e3f320c5871b841f5c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.536200+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a061d8e3f320c5871b841f5c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a061d8e3f320c5871b841f5c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Fox Hollow is a great trail to hike on weekends; the views are awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-638c6a15a9378c94c479aa58", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.552284+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "638c6a15a9378c94c479aa58", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "638c6a15a9378c94c479aa58", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Cool, gonna give it a try. Thanks for the suggestion!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-c8230dc35ed3a5c2e89beb83", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.565028+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c8230dc35ed3a5c2e89beb83", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c8230dc35ed3a5c2e89beb83", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: No problem! Let me know how you like it. Have fun hiking!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-754120663f71af9526ef0968", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.580395+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "754120663f71af9526ef0968", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "754120663f71af9526ef0968", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Thanks! I'll let you know. Have a good one!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-994663ee5a786aaf2882a535", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.594863+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "994663ee5a786aaf2882a535", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "994663ee5a786aaf2882a535", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Take care and have a good one! See ya!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_1-d419e22dc857bcdebfecf0af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:46:51.609905+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d419e22dc857bcdebfecf0af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d419e22dc857bcdebfecf0af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
